&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-195" data-path-to-node="18,2,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="18,2,0,0"&gt;Strong conceptual thinking and artistic problem-solving abilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="18,2,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-196" data-path-to-node="18,3,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="18,3,0,0"&gt;Ability to manage time effectively, work under pressure, and meet strict deadlines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="18,3,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;What Success Looks Like in This Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="21"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-197" data-path-to-node="21,0,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="21,0,0,0"&gt;Consistently transforming abstract product ideas into engaging, marketable visual assets across touchpoints&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="21,0,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-198" data-path-to-node="21,1,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="21,1,0,0"&gt;High brand aesthetic consistency and technical alignment across all digital art and user experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="21,1,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
