&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-204" data-path-to-node="23"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="23" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;&lt;span class="citation-64 citation-65 citation-end-65"&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node="23"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="24,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="24,0" data-index-in-node="2"&gt;&lt;span class="citation-62 citation-63 citation-end-63"&gt;Cultur&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="citation-62"&gt;e:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class="citation-62 citation-end-62"&gt; We put our people first and prioritize the well-being of every team member&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="24,2"&gt;&lt;span class="citation-61 citation-end-61"&gt;. We’ve built a company where all opinions carry weight and wher&lt;/span&gt;e all voices are heard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="24,4"&gt;. We value and respect each other and always look out for one another&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="24,6"&gt;. Above all, we are human&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="24,8"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
