&lt;li data-path-to-node="25"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="26,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="26,0" data-index-in-node="2"&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll receive an attractive salary, pension, health insurance, annual bonus, plus other benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="26,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
