&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nscale is the GPU cloud engineered for AI. We provide cost-effective, high-performance infrastructure for AI start-ups and&amp;nbsp;large enterprise customers. Nscale enables AI-focused companies to achieve superior results by reducing the complexity&amp;nbsp;of AI development. Our GPU cloud bolsters technical capabilities and directly supports strategic business outcomes,&amp;nbsp;including cost management, rapid innovation, and environmental responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;We thrive on a culture of relentless innovation, ownership, and accountability, where every team member takes pride in&amp;nbsp;their work and drives it with excellence and urgency. As an Nscaler, you’ll build trust through openness and transparency,&amp;nbsp;where everyone is inspired to do their best work. If you join our team, you’ll be contributing to building the technology that powers the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You'll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer" data-start="0" data-end="33"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Operations &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="35" data-end="800"&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="la1zty" data-start="35" data-end="168"&gt;Build and improve shared cloud-native platform capabilities used by internal engineering teams to run AI applications and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1x023cq" data-start="169" data-end="363"&gt;Own significant parts of the platform area, including Kubernetes cluster operations, workload runtime configuration, deployment workflows, observability foundations, or environment automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="p65bfh" data-start="364" data-end="503"&gt;Improve the reliability, scalability, and supportability of platform services through practical engineering and operational enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1s34yl" data-start="504" data-end="649"&gt;Develop automation, tooling, and configuration that reduce manual effort, improve consistency, and make the platform easier to use and operate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="ql2c3v" data-start="650" data-end="800"&gt;Apply software engineering where it creates leverage, including scripts, services, CI/CD automation, operational tooling, and platform integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start="802" data-end="839"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability, Operability &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="841" data-end="1494"&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1djncd1" data-start="841" data-end="944"&gt;Improve incident prevention, detection, response, and recovery across the platform areas you support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1obc4dq" data-start="945" data-end="1092"&gt;Build and refine observability for platform services, including metrics, logs, tracing, dashboards, alerts, and other useful operational signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1oc0u7n" data-start="1093" data-end="1212"&gt;Strengthen rollout safety, capacity awareness, failure handling, and recovery procedures for production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1yqoexr" data-start="1213" data-end="1377"&gt;Debug and resolve complex issues spanning Kubernetes, Linux, networking, storage, workload runtime behaviour, and cloud or datacentre infrastructure dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1cvooz5" data-start="1378" data-end="1494"&gt;Enhance operational playbooks, runbooks, and engineering practices to reduce toil and increase service resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1496" data-end="1523"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Technical Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="1525" data-end="2050"&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1v0hlan" data-start="1525" data-end="1638"&gt;Contribute to design discussions, code reviews, and operational standards within the platform engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="zygk51" data-start="1639" data-end="1809"&gt;Collaborate with software engineering, infrastructure, and SRE teams to deliver platform capabilities that are practical, supportable, and aligned to operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1vic99g" data-start="1810" data-end="1922"&gt;Define sensible defaults, paved roads, and supportable patterns for service deployment and runtime operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1ridf61" data-start="1923" data-end="2050"&gt;Mentor less experienced engineers in platform engineering fundamentals, operational judgement, and good automation practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2052" data-end="2056"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPIs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="2058" data-end="2264" data-is-only-node="" data-is-last-node=""&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="mdxy6s" data-start="2058" data-end="2103"&gt;Platform reliability and service resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="y9hekq" data-start="2104" data-end="2142"&gt;Reduction in manual operational toil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="yr1ml8" data-start="2143" data-end="2201"&gt;Incident detection, response, and recovery effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="14lifji" data-start="2202" data-end="2264" data-is-last-node=""&gt;Observability and operational readiness of platform services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="114lrag" data-start="0" data-end="94"&gt;Strong hands-on experience operating and improving Kubernetes-based platforms in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1nc8qtf" data-start="95" data-end="205"&gt;Solid experience with infrastructure automation, CI/CD, configuration management, or GitOps-style workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="14lwduc" data-start="206" data-end="356"&gt;Strong understanding of reliability engineering principles, including observability, incident response, failure analysis, and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="13ctnvm" data-start="357" data-end="476"&gt;Experience writing production-quality automation, tooling, or backend code in Go, Python, Bash, or similar languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1gjxon0" data-start="477" data-end="587"&gt;Good Linux fundamentals, including processes, filesystems, cgroups, service behaviour, and system debugging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="rq819" data-start="588" data-end="713"&gt;Good networking fundamentals, including TCP/IP, DNS, routing, load balancing, and container or overlay networking concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="l36g59" data-start="714" data-end="793"&gt;Experience debugging complex production issues across multiple system layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1m3ocsl" data-start="794" data-end="912"&gt;Ability to work independently on substantial technical problems while collaborating effectively with adjacent teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="vv8bdd" data-start="913" data-end="1014" data-is-last-node=""&gt;Experience mentoring or supporting less experienced engineers through practical technical guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Can Offer You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have the opportunity to help shape the operating standards behind a next-generation AI cloud platform, working on complex infrastructure challenges with real ownership and impact. This is a chance to play a meaningful role in scaling high-performance, sustainable data centre operations in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunities Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strongly encourage applications from people of colour, the LGBTQ+ community, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, parents, carers, and people from lower socio-economic backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there’s anything we can do to accommodate your specific situation, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The responsibilities outlined in this job description are not exhaustive and are intended to provide a general overview of the position. The employee may be required to perform additional duties, tasks, and responsibilities as assigned by management, consistent with the skills and qualifications required for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1765375172804000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ncte4rmlGl8OKuFuDgDtx"&gt;Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:principal-backbone-edge-archit:
&lt;h2&gt;About Nscale&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nscale is the GPU cloud engineered for AI. We provide cost-effective, high-performance infrastructure for AI start-ups and large enterprise customers. Nscale enables AI-focused companies to achieve superior results by reducing the complexity of AI development. Our GPU cloud bolsters technical capabilities and directly supports strategic business outcomes, including cost management, rapid innovation, and environmental responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Nscale, our AI Infrastructure team plays a critical role in building the global network infrastructure that powers our GPU cloud platform, enabling reliable, high-performance connectivity across our data centres, customers, cloud partners, and global backbone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive on a culture of relentless innovation, ownership, and accountability, where every team member takes pride in their work and drives it with excellence and urgency. As an Nscaler, you'll build trust through openness and transparency, where everyone is inspired to do their best work. If you join our team, you'll be contributing to building the technology that powers the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Principal Network Backbone &amp;amp; Edge Architect to serve as the senior technical design authority for Nscale's global network infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will design, validate, and own the technical standards governing our transport networks — from GPU data centre edge through WAN and backbone transport to cloud exchange connectivity and Internet peering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly influential individual contributor role. While you won't have direct reports, your architectural decisions will define what gets built, how it gets built, and how Nscale's global network evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You'll work across our global network organisation and engage directly with carriers, technology vendors, hyperscalers, and enterprise customers. We're looking for someone equally comfortable developing detailed architecture and design standards, evaluating emerging network technologies, and being hands-on in a data centre validating a new backbone node.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you'll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Standards&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and maintain Nscale's global network architecture standards across DC edge, WAN edge, backbone transport, cloud exchange, OOB/management, and automation architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the design of new network infrastructure deployments across regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Produce detailed network designs, topology documentation, IP addressing schemes, and routing policy frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define technology selection criteria and lead vendor and technology evaluations for major network infrastructure decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct architecture reviews for significant network changes, ensuring alignment with global standards before implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute network architecture requirements to data centre design reviews from the earliest stages of new facility planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Technology Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own Nscale's network technology roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and evaluate emerging capabilities including 800G/1.6T coherent optics, AI-driven network operations, and next-generation cloud exchange integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Produce and maintain technology horizon documentation to inform investment planning and strategic supplier discussions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evaluate and recommend technologies, vendors, and platforms aligned with Nscale's commercial objectives, operating model, and growth plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Technical Governance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as the final technical authority for major network design decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review and approve significant network designs before implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify technical risks within proposed architectures and drive resolution before they reach production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain and evolve Nscale's network design standards library, ensuring documentation remains current and actionable across regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; Customer Engagement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engage directly with strategic technology and connectivity partners on architecture roadmaps, capabilities, and technical partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support enterprise customer and hyperscaler engagements, including architecture walkthroughs, connectivity design reviews, and technical due diligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with carrier and colocation partners on complex challenges including multi-site diversity, capacity planning, and technology evolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with Product and Sales teams to translate network architecture capabilities into customer-facing value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;12+ years of network engineering experience, including at least 4 years in a senior architecture or Principal Engineering role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep expertise in large-scale IP/MPLS network design, SRv6, IPv6, BGP, traffic engineering, and multi-AS routing architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience designing carrier-grade backbone and WAN infrastructure for hyperscale or large-scale data centre environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on expertise with Nokia SR routing platforms and coherent optical transport architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong working knowledge of data centre fabric architecture, cloud exchange platforms, and customer connectivity design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with network automation architecture, including OpenConfig, NETCONF, YANG, and API-driven infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong ability to produce high-quality architecture designs, technical documentation, and standards frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track record of strategic vendor and technology evaluation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience engaging enterprise customers and hyperscalers in technical architecture discussions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of carrier ecosystems across EMEA, APAC, and the Americas is strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Nscale, you'll find a collaborative, supportive, and innovative environment where your contributions spark real impact. We're building something extraordinary, and we want you at the core.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly competitive package (base + equity) with reviews every 12 months. 🚀&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join one of the fastest-growing AI infrastructure companies — your opportunity to define the global network architecture powering the next generation of AI. ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expect a dynamic progression plan tailored to your ambitions. Shape technical strategy, evaluate emerging technologies, and influence how Nscale's global network evolves as we scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Human-First Flexibility: We treat you as humans first. 🫶🏽 Our flexible workplace trusts Nscalers to deliver, giving you the autonomy to shape your day around life's moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunities Statement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strongly encourage applications from people of colour, the LGBTQ+ community, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, parents, carers, and people from lower socio-economic backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there's anything we can do to accommodate your specific situation, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The responsibilities outlined in this job description are not exhaustive and are intended to provide a general overview of the position. The employee may be required to perform additional duties, tasks, and responsibilities as assigned by management, consistent with the skills and qualifications required for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1765375172804000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ncte4rmlGl8OKuFuDgDtx"&gt;Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-software-engineer-i-fro:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to give everyone the belief they can make their move. We aim to make moving simpler, by giving everyone the best place to turn to and return to for access to the tools, expertise, trust, and belief to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re home to the UK’s largest choice of properties and are the go-to destination for millions of people planning their next move, reading the latest industry news, or just browsing what’s on the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 222, 182);"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; London Office / Hybrid (3 days a week working from home)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 222, 182);"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Engineering Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 222, 182);"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer I, you will own the delivery of&amp;nbsp;high-quality software and products, able to be deployed&amp;nbsp;frequently&amp;nbsp;and safely into production. Working with similarly minded people, you collaborate with your team to encourage best coding practices. You are an advocate of test automation and have a clear view of where to make the best use of it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;At Rightmove we work as part of autonomous cross-functional teams in an agile environment. Each team owns a part of the Rightmove experience made up of design,&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;and engineering. You will deliver quality solutions that satisfy millions of users, thousands of&amp;nbsp;agents&amp;nbsp;and hundreds of passionate&amp;nbsp;Rightmovers. You will contribute towards defining solutions to business and technical problems in a way which ensures maintainability, scalability and&amp;nbsp;high performance&amp;nbsp;standards. We work collaboratively across a mix of product and centralised teams, together working towards Rightmove’s strategy. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;For a glimpse into the technical make-up of the UKs favourite property portal works, head to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 222, 182);"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a style="color: rgb(0, 222, 182);" href="https://rightmove.blog/"&gt;tech blog.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 222, 182);"&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Design and deliver impactful features across our applications using technologies such as TypeScript, React, Node.js, Express, Kubernetes, and GitLab.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Collaborate with cross‑functional partners to solve meaningful problems and build thoughtful, scalable solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Contribute actively to sprint planning, helping shape the roadmap and influence feature prioritisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Participate in engineering forums and initiatives that strengthen our craft and promote continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Share knowledge and mentor others, helping to foster an inclusive, supportive culture of learning and growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Provide clear, considered estimates for user stories to support effective team planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Engage in constructive code reviews, offering supportive feedback and championing high‑quality engineering practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Explore and advocate for emerging technologies that enhance our platform, developer experience, and ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Work effectively in an Agile environment, embracing collaboration, experimentation, and iterative improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 222, 182); font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;We’re looking for someone who:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Has proven experience in a user‑facing product team, understanding customer needs and the real‑world impact of their work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Is passionate about quality, with hands‑on experience in TDD and tools like Jest and React Testing Library.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Values clean, maintainable code and enjoys discussing different ideas and approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Has experience mentoring and supporting other engineers, contributing to an environment where everyone can thrive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;May have experience with modern Angular and/or Java;&amp;nbsp;this is a bonus, not a requirement. What matters most is a willingness to work across boundaries and contribute across the stack when needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Is curious about how users interact with live applications, and motivated to improve performance, usability, and overall experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Embraces modern technologies and brings a mindset of continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Feels comfortable asking questions, sharing ideas, and learning from others in a collaborative team setting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 222, 182);"&gt;Our approach to AI:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;At Rightmove, we believe software and product are ultimately people problems, and everything we build aims to improve the lives of others. We see AI as a helpful way to create more space for the human side of our work, from understanding real needs to making sure we are solving the right problems in the right way. There is an expectation that you are proactive in exploring how AI can support your own workflow and productivity, and that you approach it with curiosity and an open mind.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 4, 67);"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Rightmove&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to give everyone the belief that they can make their move. We aim to make moving simpler by giving everyone the best place to turn to and return to for access to the tools, expertise, trust and belief to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We're home to the UK's largest choice of properties, and are the go-to destination for millions of people planning their next move, reading the latest industry news, or just browsing what's on the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Despite this growth, we’ve remained a friendly, supportive place to work, with employee #1 still working here!&amp;nbsp; We’ve done this by placing the Rightmove Hows at the heart of everything we do. These are the essential values that reflect our culture, and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;value…&lt;/strong&gt;by delivering results and building trust with partners and consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;think&amp;nbsp;bigger…&lt;/strong&gt;by acting with curiosity and setting bold aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;care&amp;nbsp;deeply…&lt;/strong&gt;by being real, having fun, and valuing diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;move&amp;nbsp;together…&lt;/strong&gt;by being one team - internally collaborative, externally competitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&amp;nbsp;make&amp;nbsp;a difference…&lt;/strong&gt;by focusing on delivering measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in careers that open doors and help our team develop by providing an open and inclusive work environment, offering ongoing training opportunities, and supporting charity fundraising events. And with &lt;strong&gt;88% of Rightmovers saying we’re a great place to work&lt;/strong&gt;, we’re clearly doing something right!&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 4, 67);"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style="max-width: 100%;"&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cash plan for dental, optical and physio treatments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance, Pension and Life Insurance, Employee Assistance Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 days holiday plus two (paid) volunteering days a year to give back, and holiday buy schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory stakeholder pension.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance at 4x your basic salary to a spouse, family member or other nominated person in your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid leave for maternity, paternity, adoption &amp;amp; fertility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Loans, Bike to Work scheme, Rental Deposit Loan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Charitable contributions through Payroll Giving and donation matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access deals and discounts on things like travel, electronics, fashion, gym memberships, cinema discounts and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer hybrid working with a minimum of 2 days in the office. For our roles, such as Field or Home-based positions, different working arrangements apply - full details will be shared during the recruitment process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 222, 180);"&gt;&lt;img style="max-width: 100%;" src="https://www.rightmove.co.uk/careers/content/uploads/2026/09/Untitled-30-July-2026-at-10.03.05-6.png" alt="If all of this has caught your eye, you may well be a Rightmover in the making - Banner image" width="1000"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;As an Equal Opportunity Employer, Rightmove will never discriminate based on age, disability, sex, race, religion or belief, gender reassignment, marriage / civil partnership, pregnancy/maternity or sexual orientation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Rightmove, we believe that a diverse and inclusive workforce leads to better innovation, productivity, and overall success., We are committed to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for all employees, regardless of their background or identity, to develop and promote a diverse culture that reflects the communities we serve.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;By applying, you confirm that you are aged at least 18 or over and&amp;nbsp;that you’ve read and understood our &lt;a class="decorated-link" href="https://www.rightmove.co.uk/c/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" data-start="192" data-end="259"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="193" data-end="211"&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how we handle and protect your personal information during the recruitment process.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:engineering-manager-customer-l:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our vision is to give everyone the belief they can make their move. We aim to make moving simpler, by giving everyone the best place to turn to and return to for access to the tools, expertise, trust, and belief to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re home to the UK’s largest choice of properties and are the go-to destination for millions of people planning their next move, reading the latest industry news, or just browsing what’s on the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 4"&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 4"&gt;London - Soho Office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 4"&gt; / Hybrid (2 days per week in the office Weds &amp;amp; Thurs)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 4"&gt;Reporting to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 4"&gt;Head of Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:40}"&gt; -&amp;nbsp; Customer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 222, 182);"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 4"&gt;The Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;This role is in the Customer domain - the area that builds and operates the technologies used by our customers to list properties on Rightmove. We primarily use NodeJS and Java (Spring Boot) on Google Cloud Platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Engineering Manager to lead one or more of our cross-functional product development teams at Rightmove. You’ll be responsible for building a healthy, high-performing team by enabling others to do their best work, maintaining strong delivery focus, and fostering a culture that reflects our values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Engineering Managers at Rightmove are not just people leaders, but delivery enablers, engineering advocates, and strategic partners to Product Managers.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;work collaboratively to ensure teams are focusing on the right things, solving valuable problems, and&amp;nbsp;operating&amp;nbsp;in a sustainable, inclusive way.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;a big impact&amp;nbsp;on the shape of our engineering organisation, playing a key role in how we plan, deliver, grow talent, and scale systems across the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;For a glimpse into the technical make-up of the UKs favourite property portal works, head to&amp;nbsp;our&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 222, 182);"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 222, 182);"&gt;&lt;a style="color: rgb(0, 222, 182);" href="https://rightmove.blog/"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink"&gt;tech blog.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(0, 222, 182);"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 4"&gt;What&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 4"&gt;you'll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 4"&gt;&amp;nbsp;be doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 4"&gt;People and Team Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
